the door's address is under /desktop
POST /desktop/v1/messages is answered
POST /desktop/v1/messages?beta=true is answered
a streamed turn through the door is answered as Anthropic's stream
POST /desktop/v1/messages/count_tokens is answered
POST /desktop/v1/messages/count_tokens?beta=true is answered
a request that names a selector runs that model on its head
a selector of another head runs that model on that head
every ID a head's own /v1/models lists is a selector the door runs on that head
a session that has named no selector is on the head of the default model
a session is on the head of the last selector it named
the Mantle spelling of Opus runs the model the head names for its opus tier
the Mantle spelling of Haiku runs the model the head names for its haiku tier
an ID with the region prefix us. runs its tier's model
an ID with the region prefix global. runs its tier's model
an ID with a version suffix runs its tier's model
an ID with a region prefix and a version suffix runs its tier's model
the bare ID of Opus runs the opus tier's model
the bare ID of Haiku runs the haiku tier's model
the alias opus runs the opus tier's model
the alias haiku runs the haiku tier's model
a tier the head names no model for runs the head's pinned model
the alias of a tier the head names no model for runs the head's pinned model
a model the door does not serve is refused 400 invalid_request_error
the refusal of a model the door does not serve names splice desktop
a refused model sends nothing upstream
a selector of a head that is not in the door is refused with nothing sent upstream
a selector of no head is refused with nothing sent upstream
a model its head does not list is refused with nothing sent upstream
a failure of the head's provider is answered through the door as the head's own route answers it
a restart does not move the door
